            {0xE74D94EE,"Sets the kinetic type: how the object moves from now on (which kinetic energies are on: gravity, air / ground control, the animation's own TransN movement, brakes, ...). Fighter types (FIGHTER_KINETIC_TYPE_*): 0x0 FALL: in the air with air drift and gravity (most aerials and air actions); 0x1 JUMP: a jump's rise (JumpF / JumpB); 0x2 JUMP_AERIAL: double jump; 0x3 FLY: extra mid-air jumps (multi-jumpers); 0x4 JUMP_CLIFF: ledge jump (?); 0x5 JUMP_CLIFF_VERTICAL: straight-up ledge jump (?); 0x6 GROUND_STOP: on the ground, no control; the animation's TransN movement is off (most ground attacks); 0x7 RUN_STOP: run brake (RunBrake, TurnRunBrake); 0x8 GLIDE_START: glide start (?); 0x9 GLIDE_LANDING_STOP: glide landing (?); 0xA AIR_STOP: in the air with no drift control (aerial specials); 0xB AIR_STOP_X_NORMAL_MAX: AIR_STOP with the horizontal speed held to the normal max (?); 0xC AIR_ESCAPE: air dodge movement (?); 0xD AIR_BRAKE: air speed brakes to a stop (?); 0xE MOTION_LOOP: animation movement for a looping animation (?); 0xF MOTION: the animation moves the fighter (TransN), no control (JumpSquat, rolls, LandingAir); 0x10 MOTION_IGNORE_NORMAL: animation movement, ignoring the ground's slope (?); 0x11 MOTION_AIR: animation movement in the air (?); 0x12 MOTION_AIR_ANGLE: animation movement in the air along an angle; ignores gravity; 0x13 MOTION_FALL: falling with air control (Fall, SpecialFall, EscapeAir, MissFoot); 0x14 MOTION_CLIFF_MOVE: moving onto the ledge (CliffCatch, 2 frames); 0x15 MOTION_CLIFF: hanging on the ledge (CliffCatch, CliffWait, CliffJumpQuick1); 0x16 MOTION_CLIFF_GROUND: ledge to ground (CliffEscapeQuick); 0x17 MOTION_CLIFF_ROBBED: pushed off the ledge (ledge trumped); 0x18 LADDER: on a ladder (?); 0x19 MOTION_LADDER: animation movement on a ladder (?); 0x1A MOTION_BIND: held in place by the animation (?); 0x1B DASH: initial dash (no backward control); 0x1C SHOOT_DASH: dash while shooting (?); 0x1D SHOOT_BACK_DASH: back dash while shooting (?); 0x1E SLIP_DASH: slipping dash (?); 0x1F TURN_RUN: turning around in a run (TurnRun); 0x20 DAMAGE_GROUND: hit on the ground (knockback slide) (?); 0x21 DAMAGE_AIR: hit in the air (?); 0x22 DAMAGE_FLY: launched (tumble) (?); 0x23 DAMAGE_AIR_S_BREAK: launched, horizontal break (?); 0x24 DAMAGE_AIR_REFLECT_LR: launched, bounced off a wall (?); 0x25 DAMAGE_AIR_REFLECT_U: launched, bounced off a ceiling (?); 0x26 DAMAGE_KNOCK_BACK: knockback (?); 0x27 PASSIVE_WALL: wall tech (?); 0x28 PASSIVE_WALL_JUMP: wall tech jump (?); 0x29 WALL_JUMP: wall jump (?); 0x2A DETACH_WALL: letting go of a wall (wall clingers) (?); 0x2B DETACH_WALL_JUMP: jumping off a wall cling (?); 0x2C DETACH_WALL_FALL: falling off a wall cling (?); 0x2D STOP_CEIL: stopped by a ceiling (?); 0x2E CAPTURE: being grabbed (?); 0x2F CATCH_CUT: grab release (?); 0x30 CAPTURE_JUMP: grab release jump (?); 0x31 RAGDOLL: ragdoll (?); 0x32 UNIQ: the fighter's own handling (?); 0x33 RESET: all energies stopped / reset (?); 0x34 RESET_NORMAL: reset, normal (?); 0x35 TURN: turn around (walk acceleration x0.3); 0x36 ITEM_LIFT_WALK: walking with a heavy item (?); 0x37 ITEM_SWING_DASH: dash with a swung item (?); 0x38 ITEM_DASH_THROW: dash throw of an item (?); 0x39 SWIM_DIVE: swimming: dive (?); 0x3A SWIM_RISE: swimming: rise (?); 0x3B SWIM: swimming (?); 0x3C SWIM_STOP: swimming: stop (?); 0x3D SWIM_JUMP_CHARGE: swimming: jump charge (?); 0x3E SWIM_DROWN: drowning (?); 0x3F SWIM_DROWN_OUT: drowned out (?); 0x40 SUPER_JUMP_PUNCH: Mario-style up special (?); 0x41 SUPER_JUMP_PUNCH_AIR: the same, in the air (?); 0x42 SUPER_JUMP_PUNCH_AIR_TRANS: the same, air transition (?); 0x43 FALL_FREE: free fall (?); 0x44 FALL_ICE: fall while frozen (?); 0x45 JUMP_ICE: jump while frozen (?); 0x46 GEKIKARA_RUN: super-spicy-curry run (?); 0x47 SCREW_JUMP: Screw Attack item jump (?); 0x48 SCREW_JUMP_AERIAL: the same, in the air (?); 0x49 CATCH_CUT_GOKULIN: released by Gulpin (?); 0x4A REBOUND: rebound (?); 0x4B REBOUND_JUMP: rebound jump (?); 0x4C PIT_FALL: pitfall (?); 0x4D PASSIVE_GROUND: ground tech (?); 0x4E PASSIVE_GROUND_MOTION: tech roll (animation movement) (?); 0x4F JUMP_AERIAL_MOTION: double jump moved by the animation (Ness, Mewtwo); 0x50 JUMP_AERIAL_MOTION_2ND: the same, second jump (?); 0x51 GUARD_ON: shield (?); 0x52 SLIP: tripping (?); 0x53 CAPTURE_BEETLE: caught by the Beetle item; 0x54 DAMAGE_AIR_REFLECT_D: launched, bounced off the floor (?); 0x55 AIR_LASSO_HANG: tether hanging (?); 0x56 AIR_LASSO_REWIND: tether rewind (?); 0x57 DAMAGE_FALL: falling after damage (?); 0x58 SONG_FALL: falling asleep from Sing (?); 0x59 FINAL_END_JUMP: Final Smash end jump (?); 0x5A DASH_BACK: back dash (?); 0x5B FREE: free (?). 0x64 and up are the fighter's own (set up by its MSC), e.g. Kirby 0x68 = homing (side B). Meanings marked (?) are read from the names only. Read / change it from a script with variable 0x0F000330 (needs the patched cross_f.rpx)."},
